## 5. VISUALIZATION TYPES

| VISUALIZATION | PURPOSE |
|---|---|
| Stat | Displays one important number |
| Time series | Displays metrics over time |
| Gauge | Displays a value against a range |
| Bar chart | Compares values |
| Table | Displays data in rows and columns |
| Pie chart | Shows proportions |
| State timeline | Displays state changes over time |
| Heatmap | Displays distributions over time |

EXAMPLES:

Stat:
Total number of Kubernetes pods.

Time series:
CPU usage over time.

Gauge:
Memory utilization percentage.

Table:
Kubernetes pod information.

