## 6. USEFUL PROMQL QUERIES FOR GRAFANA

These queries are entered inside Grafana's panel query editor.

TOTAL PODS:
```promql
count(kube_pod_info)
```

RUNNING PODS:
```promql
count(kube_pod_status_phase{phase="Running"} == 1)
```

TOTAL NODES:
```promql
count(kube_node_info)
```

CPU USAGE:
```promql
100 - (avg by (instance) (
  rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle"}[5m])
) * 100)
```

MEMORY USAGE:
```promql
100 * (
  1 -
  node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes /
  node_memory_MemTotal_bytes
)
```

CONTAINER RESTARTS (LAST HOUR):
```promql
sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total[1h]))
```

PENDING PODS:
```promql
count(kube_pod_status_phase{phase="Pending"} == 1)
```

