## 9. SAVE AND EXPORT DASHBOARDS

To save:
1. Open your dashboard.
2. Click Save dashboard.
3. Give it a name.
4. Click Save.

To export:
1. Open the dashboard.
2. Open Dashboard settings.
3. Find JSON Model or Export (depending on Grafana version).
4. Export the dashboard JSON.

Save exported dashboards in your project:

grafana/dashboards/

JSON exports allow you to back up and reuse dashboard configurations.

