## 13. IMPORTANT THINGS TO REMEMBER

1. Grafana is NOT a database.
2. Prometheus stores the metrics.
3. Grafana retrieves metrics from Prometheus.
4. PromQL is the query language used in our panels.
5. Saved dashboards retain their panel queries.
6. You can reuse the same queries in multiple dashboards.
7. Dashboard JSON files can be exported and backed up.
